# vx-test.scm's own run artifacts (per-testcase output files it diffs
# against testcases/good/, plus tmp1-3 from r4rstest.scm's own file-I/O
# conformance tests)
testcases/*.out
testcases/tmp1
testcases/tmp2
testcases/tmp3



# Debug symbol bundles and the sanitizer build (see `make asan`)
*.dSYM/
vx-scheme-asan

# Generated from lib/prelude.scm at build time (see src/Makefile)
src/vx_embedded_libs.h

# The wasm build. Deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# It was, on the argument that clone-and-serve is the deployment model —
# but nobody clones this, and two people now send each other diffs, so
# every patch has to route around a binary that conflicts on any branch
# that rebuilt. It also cost a wrong diagnosis: a committed artifact can
# disagree with its source, and twice the answer "your cache is stale"
# was given about a file that was fine.
#
# Rebuild with `make -C src wasm`. `make test` builds it first, so the
# test suite needs nothing extra.
web/vxs.js
web/vxs.wasm
